":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1JR4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36186baf-0e49-409c-8111-f3d176d03d8d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ただこういうのは別途独自の辞書を作って管理した方が嬉しそうではある。しかし個人が作ると管理が分散してしまってもったいないので中央集権的に複数の辞書が管理できると便利そうだが…","ts":"1631798963.085500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zKgD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23547ae2-1595-426f-86a5-1c5282099ff3","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttp://openlab.ring.gr.jp/skk/wiki/wiki.cgi?page=%BA%CE%CF%BF%B4%F0%BD%E0#p49\u003e\n\u0026gt; 人名(姓・名・その他の人名)として出された登録希望は全て jinmei 辞書に自動コミットされます。人の名前は「存在しない」ことの証明がほぼ不可能なため審査のしようがないので、性善説を採っているわけです。\n:hee:","ts":"1631798933.085400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MSr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a14703a-6282-40a6-9538-7dd6002918ea","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`その他の人名(フルネームなど)` って分類っぽいので声優くらいであれば入っていてもよさそうな気もするが…基準は不明","ts":"1631798880.084200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UJ4/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba13406c-d3ec-4466-9dd1-ce54f3f688e7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"採録の基準が難しそう。。","ts":"1631798835.083600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ELrg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a91cd706-5ef6-4859-a186-93e04eb7301b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"2018 年に声優がたくさん","ts":"1631798800.083300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q0q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"555e6f9c-047c-49bd-ad8e-4d4a3da04d39","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"辞書のデータ自体の管理はなかなか難儀そう","ts":"1631798784.083000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nlnm="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec486ba3-25a2-4cc4-ade